nned) from spaCy's GitHub releases into Hermes's own Python environment, and `hermes limbic setup` also pre-downloads both ONNX models; memory stays local in limbic.db under HERMES_HOME, facts whose trust decays to zero are deleted automatically, and hermes backup adds VACUUM snapshots under HERMES_HOME/backups; no telemetry."
